Third-party assets and marks

- LCARS GTJ3: a fan-made LCARS display typeface supplied by the theme's author as
  `LCARSGTJ3.zip`. Its own license is unknown; it is embedded as a base64 `woff2`
  data URI inside `client.js` (and kept as `fonts/LCARSGTJ3.woff2` in the source
  repository). This MIT license does not grant rights to that typeface: remove the
  `@font-face` rule if redistribution is not permitted where you publish the theme.
- Glow Sans (未来荧黑): SIL Open Font License. It is only referenced by family name
  (`Glow Sans SC Condensed Bold`), not bundled, so it must be installed locally.
- LCARS, Star Trek and related marks belong to CBS Studios / Paramount. This is an
  unofficial fan theme and ships no Star Trek artwork: every shape in the theme
  derives from generic geometric geometry, and the palette follows the
  LCARS_CSS_Grid template, which its author releases for unrestricted use.
- DeepSeek and the DeepSeek Harness name belong to DeepSeek. The theme only
  restyles their user interface and ships none of their assets.
